# Wave T51 (Astral kit): muralpanel — a standing stone panel carved and painted with the shrine murals' glyphs (crescent moon, star, leaf), copied by hand one panel a season: HISTORIAN BLYTHE's own dialogue ('I copy the shrine murals by hand, one panel a season') and the Backstory Sync Audit's Astral row ('mural panels copied one panel a season: design = tale + sign'), realized as dressing at the OLD SHRINE sign's shoulder and beside BLYTHE's post; no actor, no dialogue, no event invented. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in at the MEASURED tg-celestic colours (#1b812b base, #1b4b2b speckle). (WAVE-T51-ASTRAL-PLAN.md §5.)
